%% Diagram 9: UML Sequence Diagram — Cascade Account Deletion Flow
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pengguna as 👤 Pengguna
    participant ProfileUI as 📱 ProfileScreen
    participant AuthProv as 🔄 AuthProvider
    participant AuthRepo as 📦 AuthRepository
    participant SupaStorage as ☁️ Supabase Storage
    participant Firestore as 🔥 Cloud Firestore
    participant FirebaseAuth as 🔐 Firebase Auth
    participant KeyStore as 🗝️ FlutterSecureStorage

    Pengguna->>ProfileUI: Klik Tombol "Hapus Akun Permanen"
    ProfileUI-->>Pengguna: Tampilkan Dialog Konfirmasi Bahaya (NeoDialog)
    Pengguna->>ProfileUI: Masukkan Password / Konfirmasi Reautentikasi
    ProfileUI->>AuthProv: deleteAccount(password)
    AuthProv->>AuthRepo: executeCascadeAccountDeletion(uid)

    Note over AuthRepo,SupaStorage: Tahap 1: Pembersihan Berkas Citra Terkait
    AuthRepo->>SupaStorage: deleteAllUserMealImages(uid)
    SupaStorage-->>AuthRepo: Sukses (Seluruh foto di food-history-images/{uid} terhapus)

    Note over AuthRepo,Firestore: Tahap 2: Pembersihan Dokumen Subkoleksi Firestore
    AuthRepo->>Firestore: batchDelete(users/{uid}/meals)
    Firestore-->>AuthRepo: Sukses (Seluruh subkoleksi catatan makan terhapus)
    AuthRepo->>Firestore: delete(users/{uid})
    Firestore-->>AuthRepo: Sukses (Dokumen profil pengguna terhapus)

    Note over AuthRepo,KeyStore: Tahap 3: Pembersihan Sesi Lokal
    AuthRepo->>KeyStore: deleteAll()
    KeyStore-->>AuthRepo: Kunci terenkripsi dan token sesi dihapus bersih

    Note over AuthRepo,FirebaseAuth: Tahap 4: Penghapusan Identitas Firebase Auth
    AuthRepo->>FirebaseAuth: currentUser.delete()
    FirebaseAuth-->>AuthRepo: Kredensial akun resmi dihapus permanen

    AuthRepo-->>AuthProv: Operasi Berhasil
    AuthProv-->>ProfileUI: Sesi Diakhiri
    ProfileUI-->>Pengguna: Notifikasi Akun Berhasil Dihapus & Alihkan ke Login
